{"results":[{"url":"https://www.foodstandards.gov.au/food-standards-code","final_url":"https://www.foodstandards.gov.au/food-standards-code","title":"Food Standards Code | Food Standards Australia New Zealand","description":null,"language":"en","text":"# Food Standards Code\n\nAll food sold in Australia and New Zealand must comply with food standards. These standards are compiled in the Australia New Zealand Food Standards Code. FSANZ assesses applications to amend the Code and prepares proposals to vary existing standards or develop new ones.\n\n### Title\n\n## Guidance and resources\n\n### Card","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":1205.501713004196,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}